From cc79b4d4cd5209f42ede54e9f85d45dc7ce696f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:28:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: Add an N1 packet conversion with zero proximity
 initialization

Add a separate versioned step preserving Z2FW v1 framing and the legacy source packet. Emit explicit mode 0/HBPP 0x103, a bounded zero proximity blob, a dynamic unit calibration record and the firmware packet. Leave reset, readiness, register calibration and execute in the native N1 driver.

Reject configured/invalid profiles, malformed packets, unaligned or overlapping ranges, payload overlap and length overflow. Keep the active J72 recipe outputs empty until native hardware qualification. Synthetic cases and private working-worker wire oracles pass; no native device test is claimed.

Assisted-by: LLM
